<title>THAILAND: Thai Aug wholesale price index up 3.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Thai Aug wholesale price index up 3.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai Commerce Ministry reported on Tuesday that the August Wholesale Price Index rose 3.5 percent year-on-year to 155.7 compared to a 9.4 percent rise to 150.4 in August 1995.</p>
<p>The index was up 3.5 percent year-on-year in July 1996.</p>
<p>The WPI in August 1996 rose 0.5 percent month-on-month from a drop of 1.0 percent month-on-month in July.</p>
<p>     THAI WHOLESALE PRICES   Aug 96   July 96  Aug 95</p>
<p>     Month/month		 +0.5     -1.0     +0.5</p>
<p>     Year/year		   +3.5     +3.5     +9.4</p>
<p>     WPI Index (base 1985)  155.7     155.0    150.4</p>
</text>
